        <tfg_ontologia_ciberseguridad:hasDescription>The Activity Plus Reloaded for BuddyPress plugin for WordPress is vulnerable to Blind Server-Side Request Forgery in all versions up to, and including, 1.1.1 via the &apos;ajax_preview_link&apos; function. This makes it possible for authenticated attackers, with Subscriber-level access and above, to make web requests to arbitrary locations originating from the web application and can be used to query and modify information from internal services.</tfg_ontologia_ciberseguridad:hasDescription>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- http://www.tfg-ciberseguridad.org/ontologia/tfg_ontologia_ciberseguridad#CVE-2024-12237 -->

